1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:28,250
Where is the Fighting Evil Sect Leader ?

25
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,410
Teleportation ?

26
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,810
A Nascent Soul cultivator !

27
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:48,530
Duanmu Ji
Eight Extremes Devil Lord
Devil Lord of Qi Mei City
Middle stage Soul Formation

28
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,010
Are you the Sect Leader ?

29
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,650
No, no, no !

30
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,490
I am merely his disciple !

31
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,370
So where is he ?

32
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,810
Master has my Soul Blood...

33
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,730
If I reveal his location,

34
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,690
it will be the end for me.

35
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,450
Master...

36
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:09,930
Master, he...

37
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,290
is traveling far away...

38
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,370
You don't get to decide

39
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,650
whether you speak or not.

40
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,810
Found him.

41
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,770
I hope he'll survive.

42
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:53,450
If he doesn't, I'll die along with him...

43
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:58,170
Even with Ma Liang's talented body,

44
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,530
I don't have high hopes of forming a Nascent Soul.

45
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,890
In his memories,

46
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,890
I saw that the Divine Path

47
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:06,370
of the War God Shrine is a method to form a Nascent Soul.

48
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:09,610
It would be a shame if I didn't use Ma Liang's identity

49
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,610
to have a glimpse.

50
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,890
Disciple Ma Liang

51
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,890
requests to view the Divine Path.

52
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:19,130
Identity token.

53
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,290
You can enter.

54
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,490
Wait !

55
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,650
Greetings, Ancestor.

56
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,810
Greetings, Ancestor.

57
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,490
In just a few years,

58
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,810
he actually reached Core Formation ?

59
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,010
The Divine Path

60
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:58,730
is the secret technique of our War God Shrine.

61
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,650
Are you aware ?

62
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,850
Disciple is aware.

63
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,890
What's the meaning of a secret technique ?

64
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,730
It mustn't be revealed to outsiders.

65
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:08,010
The Divine Path is profound and mysterious.

66
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,490
It's very beneficial for forming a Nascent Soul.

67
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:13,010
But this is our War God Hall's secret technique.

68
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,050
A mere Core Formation brat

69
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,770
coveting the Divine Path

70
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:20,490
should weigh whether he has the capability.

71
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,290
Do you think the Founder of our War God Shrine

72
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,330
will accept you ?

73
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,850
Disciple understands

74
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,290
what Ancestor means.

75
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,810
He's just a rogue cultivator.

76
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,290
So what if he reached Core Formation ?

77
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,650
It seems that

78
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:43,210
this will take some more scheming...

79
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,690
Little guy,

80
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:54,890
this old man has finally found you !

81
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,450
This person's cultivation is far above mine.

82
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,290
Who is he ?

83
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:10,250
Could he be the Ancestor of someone I killed in the Sea of Devils

84
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,890
that's seeking revenge ?

85
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:13,410
He doesn't have good intentions.

86
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,570
Little guy,

87
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:28,930
this formation can't protect you.

88
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:48,690
This formation was made by all the Ancestors of the Burning Fire Alliance

89
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,890
but he easily broke it.

90
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,530
This person's cultivation is truly unfathomable...

91
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,170
Fellow cultivator,

92
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,730
why did you destroy our formation !?

93
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,810
Scram !

94
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:22,930
Senior is the Devil Lord of Qi Mei City.

95
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,810
A Soul Formation Senior !

96
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,610
This is the last warning.

97
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,650
Let me pass.

98
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,290
He vanished !?

99
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,970
How could the connection to the Soul Blood vanish ?

100
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:09,650
You absolutely cannot escape my grasp !

101
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,930
What is this Senior doing ?

102
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,010
Divine Sense Lockdown !

103
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:38,210
This is the signature formation of the Eight Extremes Devil Lord, Duanmu Ji.

104
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:41,010
From now on, every cultivator entering or leaving Xuanwu

105
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:44,090
will be under his watch.

106
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,250
Little guy,

107
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:50,010
I, the Eight Extremes Devil Lord,

108
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:52,530
will refine the entire country of Xuanwu if I need to

109
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,850
until I find you !

110
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,490
What do we do now ?

111
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,250
Nothing...

112
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,370
Whoever the Eight Extremes Devil Lord is looking for

113
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:07,170
probably won't survive.

114
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,490
This person's cultivation is high

115
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,050
and he has ill intent.

116
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,850
For now, I am completely powerless to resist him.

117
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:22,650
The only option now is to find a flaw in his formation

118
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,010
and escape this place !

119
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:47,610
3 years later

120
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,090
Little Lin,

121
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:11,690
you can't stay infinitely in the Heaven Defying Bead.

122
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,970
If all these crystals are dim

123
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:17,770
and the space turns completely black

124
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:20,610
you will never be able to leave anymore.

125
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:23,290
If you ever reach that point,

126
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:25,970
you must stay outside for 3 full days

127
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,370
before you can enter again.

128
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:31,410
I have looked for 3 years

129
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,650
but only found a single flaw in this formation.

130
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,530
However,

131
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,450
it could very well be a trap.

132
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,330
Enough,

133
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,610
I'll risk it !

134
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:14,530
How did a mere Core Formation brat do this ?

135
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:16,930
Completely concealing your aura like that

136
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:19,090
is truly unbelievable.

137
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:21,330
Little guy,

138
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,810
I have been waiting for you for 3 years !

139
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,530
How could I be worth

140
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:27,170
3 years of Senior's time ?

141
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,250
Die !

142
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,930
Why is there no Divine Sense ?

143
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,570
It's said the Death Spell

144
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:51,210
attacks using Divine Sense.

145
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:39,810
Senior went through such trouble to capture me.

146
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,610
What do you want from me ?

147
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:45,970
How do you know

148
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:48,490
I'm not here to kill you ?

149
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,010
With your cultivation,

150
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,810
you could've killed me in an instant.

151
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:54,370
But you went to great lengths

152
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,810
to trap me like that.

153
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:57,450
You...

154
00:12:57,880 --> 00:12:59,730
need something from me !

155
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:05,050
Interesting, interesting...

156
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,250
What's your name ?

157
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,650
Ma Liang

158
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:10,130
Ma Liang,

159
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,450
do you

160
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:14,010
know the Death Spell ?

161
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,850
So he mistook the Ji Realm

162
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,930
for the Death Spell.

163
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,890
Little guy, don't be nervous.

164
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:25,810
This old man merely wishes to borrow your Death Spell

165
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:28,690
in order to obtain treasures.

166
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:31,450
If you agree to accompany me,

167
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:35,730
I'll give you an Earth Transformation Pill and a Nascent Soul Formation Pill.

168
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:43,890
You're quite composed for a brat.

169
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,330
This Earth Transformation pill

170
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:49,650
will help you go from Early to Middle stage Core Formation

171
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,410
with a very high success rate.

172
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:54,490
This Nascent Soul Formation Pill is even more remarkable.

173
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:57,810
It's a rare pill that can increase the chance of forming a Nascent Soul.

174
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,650
The recipe for this pill

175
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:02,690
is only held by rank 5 countries.

176
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,930
I want to know

177
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:07,570
how dangerous the place we're going to is.

178
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,450
I won't hide it from you.

179
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:14,690
Even if Peak Late stage Nascent Soul cultivators enter it,

180
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:16,530
they might not make it out alive.

181
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,410
If you're not very careful,

182
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:22,250
death is inevitable.

183
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:23,730
But

184
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:25,770
even if that place is very dangerous,

185
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:27,490
the rewards are also immense.

186
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:29,970
Artifacts, pills, spells,

187
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,810
it has everything !

188
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,690
Besides that,

189
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:36,570
there should even be a Soul Transformation Pill.

190
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:38,770
With a single pill,

191
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:40,370
you have a chance

192
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:43,130
to leap directly to Soul Transformation.

193
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,250
So generous ?

194
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,530
The stakes must be high.

195
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,650
You need not worry

196
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,930
about how dangerous it is.

197
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,130
Your Death Spell

198
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,130
will be of great use in a particular trial.

199
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,490
This old man

200
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:02,930
will definitely ensure your safety.

201
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,730
If I refuse

202
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:07,530
he will kill me on the spot.

203
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:11,050
But 2 pills

204
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,690
are not enough.

205
00:15:14,030 --> 00:15:16,490
If it weren't for the rules of that place

206
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,890
I would have used a restriction

207
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:19,290
to control you, kid.

208
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:25,370
This is a Divine Sense mark

209
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:28,410
to prevent you from disappearing again.

210
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,530
Once we reach that place,

211
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:33,610
I will naturally remove it.

212
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,810
Who is in charge here ?

213
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,370
What's happening ?

214
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:51,370
Such a powerful pressure !

215
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:52,210
Let's see.

216
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,050
The Eight Extremes Devil Lord was looking

217
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,010
for him !?

218
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,530
Since Senior graces us with his presence,

219
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:06,530
might I ask how we can help you ?

220
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:09,930
My little friend here is quite interested in your Divine Path.

221
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:12,370
I wonder if he might have a look ?

222
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,890
This...

223
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,570
The Divine Path is the secret technique of our War God Shrine.

224
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,770
Senior...

225
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:18,810
I hate asking favors !

226
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:20,370
It's too troublesome.

227
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:23,050
I'll just level this sect instead !

228
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,010
Thank you Senior for the reminder.

229
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:27,730
Ma Liang is indeed a disciple of our War God Shrine.

230
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:30,410
He is allowed to see the Divine Path at Core Formation.

231
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:31,490
Ma Liang,

232
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:32,930
come with me.

233
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:41,850
Little friend,

234
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:44,010
I will wait for you outside.

235
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,930
If anything happens to you,

236
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:49,090
I will make sure every single person here

237
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,730
is buried alongside you !

238
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,050
Ancestor !

239
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,090
Wang Lin,

240
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,690
I forgave you for what happened.

241
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:16,210
No matter how much trouble you're in,

242
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:18,810
don't involve our War God Shrine anymore.

243
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:21,050
If you promise that to me,

244
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:23,130
I'll open the hall for you

245
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,490
to let you see the Divine Path.

246
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:28,010
Senior can rest assured.

247
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:30,850
I will leave after viewing the Divine Path

248
00:17:30,840 --> 00:17:32,290
and will never return.

249
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:47,090
This technique is very profound.

250
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:50,410
Not everyone is fated to learn it.

251
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,570
Or rather

252
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:53,370
only a very few people

253
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:55,010
are fated.

254
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,370
What do you mean ?

255
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,970
You'll understand when you see it.

256
00:18:18,120 --> 00:20:40,750
In the novel, the events of the this episode and the previous happen in a different order. Wang Lin doesn't go back to the Fighting Evil Sect after escorting Li Muwan to the Luo River Sect. In fact, the reason he hurries to send her off and refuses to stay with her is because he sensed that he was being chased by Duanmu Ji through a wisp of Divine Sense that he left behind him. He didn't want her to be endangered.

The Eight Extremes of conceptual elaboration are a philosophical concept of buddhism. Here is the list :
- arising
- ceasing
- being non-existent
- being permanent
- coming
- going
- being multiple
- being single

257
00:18:46,980 --> 00:18:54,110
Count the specks of time

258
00:18:50,860 --> 00:18:54,110
floating down gently.

259
00:18:54,220 --> 00:19:00,350
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

260
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:07,870
Forever lock away the scars

261
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:07,870
of this mortal life.

262
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:14,390
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

263
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:22,110
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

264
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:22,110
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

265
00:19:21,940 --> 00:19:29,270
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

266
00:19:23,980 --> 00:19:29,270
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

267
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:31,790
I will ask the heavens who exactly

268
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:36,550
sliced open this world

269
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:36,550
to let the rain fall in.

270
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:38,550
I will refine the world

271
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:41,070
to make our palm lines say

272
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:43,430
that we will live forever.

273
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:46,350
Walking off the beaten path

274
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:49,430
through heaven and earth.

275
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:56,390
Before returning to dust,

276
00:19:52,380 --> 00:19:56,390
I will refine this mortal body.

277
00:19:57,660 --> 00:20:05,270
The left shore is the joyous laughter

278
00:20:01,540 --> 00:20:05,270
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

279
00:20:05,020 --> 00:20:11,870
The right shore is an eternal silence

280
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:11,870
lingering under the candlelight.

281
00:20:11,820 --> 00:20:14,750
To overturn this fate,

282
00:20:14,500 --> 00:20:19,110
I will walk against the heavens.

283
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:26,270
I will even gather the clouds

284
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:26,270
to illuminate the sky for you.

285
00:20:26,420 --> 00:20:30,510
All this sadness was not meaningless.

286
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:33,830
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

287
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:39,630
I vow to break

288
00:20:35,820 --> 00:20:39,630
this chess game of fate.

289
00:20:40,700 --> 00:20:50,590
I vow to break

290
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:50,590
this chess game of fate.
